## Usage

```hcl
# From a parent root module or after cloning this repository:
terraform init
terraform plan -var="environment=dev"
```

Replace pinned module sources in `main.tf` with your estate
`tf-*` / `tfm-*` module coordinates before deploying to shared environments.

## Local development

```bash
terraform init
terraform validate
terraform test
```

The `provenance-drift` gate validates `repave.yaml` on every generate/publish.
